  "html": "<div class=\"pg-page pg-role-mechanism\" data-pg-theme=\"workbench\" data-pg-scroll=\"flow\" data-pg-role=\"mechanism\" data-pg-title=\"解析函数与 C-R 条件：可导到底查什么？\">\n<header class=\"pg-head\">\n<p class=\"pg-eyebrow\">第 2 讲 · 解析函数</p>\n<h1 class=\"pg-title\">解析函数与 C-R 条件：可导到底查什么？</h1>\n<p class=\"pg-lede\">复变函数可导不是「像实函数那样求导」：实部与虚部必须通过 C-R 方程咬合。</p>\n<ul class=\"pg-meta\">\n<li>机制</li>\n<li>约 9 分钟</li>\n<li>对应大题 11</li>\n<li>复变函数攻略 · 2.2 解析函数</li>\n</ul>\n</header>\n<nav class=\"pg-outline\" aria-label=\"本页路线\">\n<p class=\"pg-outline-label\">本页路线</p>\n<ol>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b1\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">01</span>\n<span>先看一个反例</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b2\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">02</span>\n<span>C-R 方程</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b3\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">03</span>\n<span>导数公式</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b4\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">04</span>\n<span>为什么是这两条</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b5\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">05</span>\n<span>例题 · 23-24 Q11</span>\n</button></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"pg-flow\">\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-prose\" data-mp-block=\"b1\" aria-label=\"先看一个反例\">\n<h2 class=\"pg-prose-title\">先看一个反例</h2>\n<p>实函数 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 处处可导，但写成复变函数 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=x^2+iy^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 后，沿实轴走和沿虚轴走的增量完全不同。复变函数要求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 从任意方向趋向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> 时，差商都收敛到同一个复数——这比实函数苛刻得多。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-callout pg-callout-key\" data-mp-block=\"b2\" aria-label=\"C-R 方程\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">核心</p>\n<h2>C-R 方程</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=u(x,y)+iv(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_0</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的某邻域有定义。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_0</annotation></semantics></math></span> 可导的必要条件是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的一阶偏导存在，并满足 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y,\\ u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。若 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 可微，则 C-R 也是充分条件。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-formula-block\" data-mp-block=\"b3\" aria-label=\"导数公式\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">导数公式</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(z_0)=u_x+iv_x=v_y-iu_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pg-formula-label\">可导时的导数</span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-prose\" data-mp-block=\"b4\" aria-label=\"为什么是这两条\">\n<h2 class=\"pg-prose-title\">为什么是这两条</h2>\n<p>沿实轴取 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z=\\Delta x</annotation></semantics></math></span>，差商的实部给出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>，虚部给出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>；沿虚轴取 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z=i\\Delta y</annotation></semantics></math></span>，差商变成 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_y-iu_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>。可导要求两条路径的极限相等，于是实部、虚部分别相等，正好得到 C-R。换句话说，C-R 不是记忆口诀，而是「两个方向导数必须一致」的代数化。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-example\" data-mp-block=\"b5\" aria-label=\"例题 · 23-24 Q11\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">例题 · 23-24 Q11</p>\n<p class=\"pg-example-problem\">判断 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=x^2+iy^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在何处可导、何处解析。</p>\n\n<ol class=\"pg-steps\">\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b5-s1\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">拆出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span></h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v=y^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>。分别求偏导：</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-step-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=2x,\\quad v_y=2y,\\quad u_y=0,\\quad v_x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b5-s2\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">代入 C-R</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 给出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x=2y</annotation></semantics></math></span>，即 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math></span>；<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 恒成立。所以 C-R 只在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上成立。</p>\n\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b5-s3\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">判断解析</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\">解析要求在某邻域内处处可导，而直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 没有开邻域。因此 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上可导，但在复平面内处处不解析。</p>\n\n</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"pg-answer\"><span class=\"pg-answer-label\">答案</span><div><p>在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上可导；在复平面内处处不解析。</p></div></div>\n<p class=\"pg-pitfall\"><strong>易错：</strong>C-R 成立且 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 可微只保证该点可导；解析还要求「某邻域内处处可导」。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-callout pg-callout-pitfall\" data-mp-block=\"b6\" aria-label=\"三个高频坑\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">易错</p>\n<h2>三个高频坑</h2>\n<p>① 把 C-R 当成充分条件，忘了 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 可微；② 只在一点满足 C-R 就宣布解析；③ 极坐标下写错：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_r=(1/r)v_\\theta,\\ v_r=-(1/r)u_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-check\" data-pg-check data-mp-block=\"q1\" aria-label=\"随堂检查\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">随堂检查 · q1</p>\n<p class=\"pg-question\">下列判断正确的是？</p>\n\n<div class=\"pg-options\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option>\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A</span>\n<span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=x^2+iy^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> 解析</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option data-pg-correct=\"true\">\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">B</span>\n<span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=x^2+iy^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上可导，但处处不解析</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option>\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span>\n<span>只要 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 就在该点解析</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pg-check-result\" data-pg-result aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></p>\n<p class=\"pg-explanation\" data-pg-explanation aria-live=\"polite\" hidden>C-R 只在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上成立；解析要求某邻域内处处可导。</p>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n<aside class=\"pg-rail\" aria-label=\"图示与速查\">\n<figure class=\"pg-figure\" data-pg-figure data-pg-states=\"3\" data-pg-figure-state=\"0\" aria-label=\"虚线 $y=x$；两条路径的极限必须相等\">\n<div class=\"pg-figure-head\">\n<p class=\"pg-figure-label\">图示</p>\n<div class=\"pg-figure-controls\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-sm\" data-pg-action=\"figure-prev\" aria-label=\"上一步\">‹</button>\n<span class=\"pg-figure-state\" data-pg-figure-state-label>1/3</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-sm\" data-pg-action=\"figure-next\" aria-label=\"下一步\">›</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<svg class=\"pg-figure-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"虚线 $y=x$；两条路径的极限必须相等\">\n<title>虚线 $y=x$；两条路径的极限必须相等</title>\n<line x1=\"25.71\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"25.71\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"160.00\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"160.00\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"227.14\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"227.14\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"294.29\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"294.29\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"110.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"42.86\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"42.86\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" />\n<line x1=\"22\" y1=\"177.14\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"177.14\" class=\"pg-fig-axis\" /><text x=\"297.00\" y=\"191.14\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">Re</text><line x1=\"92.86\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"92.86\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-axis\" /><text x=\"96.86\" y=\"13.00\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\">Im</text><text x=\"88.86\" y=\"190.14\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text>\n<line x1=\"92.86\" y1=\"177.14\" x2=\"240.57\" y2=\"29.43\" class=\"pg-fig-ink pg-fig-dashed\" />\n<circle cx=\"160.00\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"pg-fig-ink-fill\" /><text x=\"153.00\" y=\"126.00\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\">z₀</text>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"0\" data-pg-active=\"true\"><line x1=\"160.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"220.43\" y2=\"110.00\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" /><polygon points=\"215.93,112.60 220.43,110.00 215.93,107.40\" class=\"pg-fig-arrow\" /><text x=\"202.30\" y=\"97.00\" class=\"pg-fig-muted\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Δx</text></g>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"1\" data-pg-active=\"false\"><line x1=\"160.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"160.00\" y2=\"49.57\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" /><polygon points=\"162.60,54.07 160.00,49.57 157.40,54.07\" class=\"pg-fig-arrow\" /><text x=\"147.00\" y=\"67.70\" class=\"pg-fig-muted\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">iΔy</text></g>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"2\" data-pg-active=\"false\"><line x1=\"160.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"220.43\" y2=\"110.00\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" /><polygon points=\"215.93,112.60 220.43,110.00 215.93,107.40\" class=\"pg-fig-arrow\" /><line x1=\"160.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"160.00\" y2=\"49.57\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" /><polygon points=\"162.60,54.07 160.00,49.57 157.40,54.07\" class=\"pg-fig-arrow\" /><text x=\"190.21\" y=\"81.80\" class=\"\" font-size=\"10\">C-R</text></g>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"pg-figure-notes\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"0\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z=\\Delta x</annotation></semantics></math></span>：差商 → <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x+i v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"1\" hidden><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta z=i\\Delta y</annotation></semantics></math></span>：差商 → <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_y-i u_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"2\" hidden>实部、虚部分别相等，得到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n</div>\n<figcaption class=\"pg-figure-caption\">虚线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span>；两条路径的极限必须相等</figcaption>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-takeaway\">C-R 方程 = 两个方向导数的一致条件</p>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pg-quickfacts\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">本页目标</p>\n<ul><li>写出 C-R 方程，并解释两个方向导数为何必须一致</li><li>判断 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=x^2+iy^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在何处可导、何处解析</li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">记住</p><ul><li>C-R：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=v_y,\\ u_y=-v_x</annotation></semantics></math></span></li><li>可导 = 两条路径极限一致；解析 = 邻域内处处可导</li><li>极坐标 C-R：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_r=(1/r)v_\\theta,\\ v_r=-(1/r)u_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">易错</p><ul><li>C-R 成立不等于解析</li><li>只在一点可导不能推出解析</li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">答案速记</p><p class=\"pg-quick-answer\">在直线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上可导；在复平面内处处不解析。</p>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">下一步</p><p class=\"pg-quick-answer\">下一页：调和函数与共轭调和</p>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<footer class=\"pg-foot\">\n<p class=\"pg-source\">依据：2.2 解析函数 · 函数 f(z)=u+iv 在区域 D 内解析的充要条件是 u、v 在 D 内可微且满足 C-R  等 2 条</p>\n<div class=\"pg-controls\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"prev\">上一页</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"reset\">重置</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-primary\" data-pg-action=\"next\">下一页</button>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>",
